OL,3,GNEWSA'At 100, my independence is very
OL,4,Aimportant to me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe niece of a woman who is playing
OL,7,Fcroquet and golf, dancing, doing yoga
OL,8,Fand leading a computer group as she
OL,9,Fturns 100 has described her as a "freak
OL,10,Fof nature".
OL,12,FJean Farguson, from Midhurst, in West
OL,13,FSussex, was born on 10 September 1926
OL,14,Fand is a former Guinness World Records
OL,15,Fholder for the oldest competitive
OL,16,Ffemale croquet player.
OL,18,F"My independence is very important to
OL,19,Fme," Farguson told the BBC. "Although,
OL,20,Fmy friends are very helpful."
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
