OL,3,GNEWSA'At 100, my independence is very
OL,4,Aimportant to me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer eldest niece Joanne Farguson said
OL,7,Fshe was "inspirational", adding: "I
OL,8,Fdon't think I'll get to 100 or even
OL,9,Fanywhere near it. She's obviously a
OL,10,Ffreak of nature."
